    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24798" root="صلق" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَلَّاقٌ</span></b> , applied to a speaker, an orator, or a
preacher, (JK, IDrd, O, K,) is like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَّاقٌ</span>, (JK,)
[i. e.] <i>Eloquent;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْلَقٌ</span></b>  [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْلَقٌ</span>],
(IDrd, O, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْلَاقٌ</span></b>  [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْلَاقٌ</span>]. (O,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرْبٌ صَلَّاقٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْلَاقٌ</span></b>  <i>A vehement
striking</i> or <i>beating.</i> (M, TA.)

